            {"id": "d", "text": "Broad network access", "correct": False, "rationale": "Incorrect. Broad network access means cloud capabilities are available over the network and can be accessed through standard mechanisms by heterogeneous client platforms (phones, tablets, laptops, workstations). The scenario describes provisioning, not accessing the service over diverse network endpoints."},
